Implemented plane strain Phase field crack propagation for plate in tension and compated with LEFM.

The energy is,
E(u,\phi) = \int (\phi^2+\eta) \psi(\epsilon) + Gc[(1-\phi)^2/4l + l(\nabla \phi)^2]

\sigma = (\phi^2+\eta)\partial\psi/\partial \epsilon

div \sigma = 0.

f = \delta E/\delta \phi = 2\phi \psi(\epsilon) + Gc[ -(1-\phi)/2l -2l\Delta\phi ]

d\phi/dt = -\kappa f.

